                "start": 8
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners, the Hobbs Act does not punish freestanding acts or threats of violence."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Chemerinsky",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "fd5eeabc9fd68a299b0472553863f32138246c9eb01ea330c6c2187f522848db",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-fd5eeabc9fd6-0003-0000"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 54,
                "start": 54
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Chemerinsky, the Hobbs Act was amended to address radical animal\u2011activist violence, such as bombings of meat\u2011serving restaurants or stores owned by minorities."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Untereiner",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "fd5eeabc9fd68a299b0472553863f32138246c9eb01ea330c6c2187f522848db",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-fd5eeabc9fd6-0003-0004"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 57,
                "start": 57
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Untereiner, the Hobbs Act also covers official extortion, which does not require acts or threats of violence."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Chemerinsky",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "fd5eeabc9fd68a299b0472553863f32138246c9eb01ea330c6c2187f522848db",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-fd5eeabc9fd6-0003-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 54,
                "start": 54
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Chemerinsky, rICO provides a broad remedial scheme intended by Congress."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Ms. BLATT",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "fd5eeabc9fd68a299b0472553863f32138246c9eb01ea330c6c2187f522848db",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-fd5eeabc9fd6-0001-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 24,
                "start": 24
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Ms. BLATT, the FACE Act of 1994 gives private parties the right to seek damages and injunctive relief for blocking access to clinics."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Chemerinsky",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "fd5eeabc9fd68a299b0472553863f32138246c9eb01ea330c6c2187f522848db",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-fd5eeabc9fd6-0002-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 38,
                "start": 38
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Chemerinsky, because the case involves an injunction, the Court may consider the evidence presented in this equitable matter."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Chemerinsky",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "fd5eeabc9fd68a299b0472553863f32138246c9eb01ea330c6c2187f522848db",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-fd5eeabc9fd6-0003-0003"
